</span></td>
<td id="A7.T11.3.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T11.3.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Apply Light Correction and Boost Contrast 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Add a video, apply light correction, and increase only the contrast. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Sample Media" dropdown, select "Flower Video" and add it to the timeline. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Apply light correction to the entire clip by maxing out only the contrast value. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Export the result. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
