</span></td>
<td id="A7.T11.3.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.14.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.14.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T11.3.14.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Add Background Audio to End of Video 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Add a video and an audio clip, positioning the audio as background for the end of the video. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Sample Media" dropdown, add "Flower Video" and audio clip to the timeline. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Position the audio clip so that it plays as background audio during the end portion of the video clip. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Export the result. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.3.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.3.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T11.3.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.15.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.15.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T11.3.15.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.3.16" class="ltx_tr">
