</span></td>
<td id="A7.T11.3.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.17.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.17.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T11.3.17.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Combine Three Videos in Sequence 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Place three videos on the timeline in a specific order and export. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Sample Media" dropdown and add "Tuning a Radio", "White Candle" and "Flower Video". 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Drag all the videos to timeline and place them in same order. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Trim ends of all videos so length of each clip matches length of "Flower Video" clip. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Export the result. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
