<span id="A7.T11.3.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.20.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T11.3.20.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">7</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T11.3.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.20.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.20.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T11.3.20.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># The Quote 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Lift a middle segment out of a video, play it on its own first, then play the full original video. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Sample Media" dropdown and add "Tuning a Radio". 
<br class="ltx_break">2. On the timeline, first play only seconds 3 through 6 of the clip, then immediately after play the full original clip from start to end. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Add a 1-second text block reading "Earlier..." with white text on black background, placed immediately before the full playthrough begins. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Export the result. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
