</span></td>
<td id="A7.T11.3.23.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.23.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.3.23.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T11.3.23.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Split Video and Insert Another in the Middle 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Split a video at its midpoint and insert a second video between the two halves. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Sample Media" dropdown and select "Flower Video". 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Drag "Flower Video" to the timeline. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Split the clip at its midpoint. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Open the "Sample Media" dropdown and select "Tuning a Radio". 
<br class="ltx_break">5. Drag "Tuning a Radio" to the timeline. 
<br class="ltx_break">6. Insert "Tuning a Radio" between the two halves of "Flower Video". 
<br class="ltx_break">7. Export the result. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
