<br class="ltx_break">3. Change text blocks background colors to be "yellow", "red" and "green" accordingly to their timeline order. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Change durations of text blocks, so that each one is 2 times longer than previous one, leaving first text block duration unchanged. 
<br class="ltx_break">5. Export the result. 
<br class="ltx_break">
