<span id="A7.T12.3.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">3</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Insert a Wait Node into a Workflow 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Insert a Wait node with a 1-second delay between two existing nodes in a workflow and reconnect the flow. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Range -&gt; Map -&gt; Table (scaffolding)" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Insert a "Wait" node between the "Map" and "Table Preview" nodes. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Configure the delay to "1 second". 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Reconnect the workflow correctly. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
