<span id="A7.T12.3.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">4</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.11.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Delete a Node and Disable Default Port in Switch 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Delete a branch target node from a Switch-based pipeline and disable the corresponding default port in the Switch settings. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Data Categorization Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Delete one of the "Edit Fields (Set)" node responsible for "Default" branch of a "Switch" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Disable the "Default" port in the "Switch" node settings. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
