</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.17.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">6</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.17.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.17.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.17.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Insert a Formula Node into a Workflow 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Insert a Formula node into a workflow, configure it to compute a derived field, and reconnect the data flow. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Range -&gt; Map -&gt; Table (scaffolding)" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Insert a "Formula" node between the "Map" and "Table" nodes. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Configure the "Formula" node to name a new field ‘double‘ with value ‘item.value * 2‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Reconnect the workflow so the final path is: ‘Range -&gt; Map -&gt; Formula -&gt; Table‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.18.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.18.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.18.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.19.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_017.png" id="A7.T12.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/109;" width="476" height="109" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
