<td id="A7.T12.3.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.20.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.20.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">7</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.20.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.20.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.20.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Insert and Configure a Filter Node 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Add and configure a Filter node in an existing workflow, wiring it into the correct position in the data flow. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Range -&gt; Map -&gt; Table (scaffolding)" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Delete the rightmost "Table" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Add a "Filter" node and connect "Map" node output to the "Filter" node input . 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Configure the filter to pass only values where ‘item.value &gt; 10‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">5. The final path must be: ‘Range -&gt; Map -&gt; Filter‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.21.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.21.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.21.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.22" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.22.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.22.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.22.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_006.png" id="A7.T12.g7" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/127;" width="476" height="127" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.23" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.23.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.23.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.23.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">8</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.23.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.23.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.23.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.23.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Insert a Filter Node into an Existing Pipeline 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Insert a Filter node between two existing nodes in a pipeline and configure it with a specific condition. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Order Processing Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Add a "Filter" node between the "Database Connector" and the "If" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Configure the filter to pass only orders where ‘item.status === ’completed’‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Reconnect the workflow so the path through this section is: ‘Database Connector -&gt; Filter -&gt; If‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.24" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.24.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.24.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.24.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.24.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.24.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.25" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.25.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.25.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.25.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_007.png" id="A7.T12.g8" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/113;" width="476" height="113" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.26" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.26.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.26.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.26.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.26.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">9</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.26.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.26.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.26.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.26.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Rewire a Branch Input to a Different Node 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Rewire a branch input on a downstream node so it feeds into a different merge point in the pipeline. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Enterprise Data Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Find the "Data Table" node that receives inputs from the priority branches. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Disconnect the input coming from the lower "Edit Fields (Set)" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Reconnect that lower "Edit Fields (Set)" node into the "HTTP Request" node located on the right, below "Send Email" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.27" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.27.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.27.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.27.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.27.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.27.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.28.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.28.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_018.png" id="A7.T12.g9" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/153;" width="476" height="153" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.29" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.29.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.29.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">10</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.29.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.29.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.29.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.29.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Add an Side Branch Without Breaking Existing Output 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Add a side branch that records processed records while keeping the original main pipeline output unchanged. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Order Processing Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Find the node immediately before the final "Aggregate" output node. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Add a "No Operation" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Add a "Data Table" node after the "No Operation" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">5. Connect the node immediately before the final output node to the new "No Operation" node, leaving all other existing connections as is. 
<br class="ltx_break">6. Connect "No Operation" to the new "Data Table" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.30" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.30.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.30.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.30.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.30.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.30.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.31" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.31.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.31.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.31.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_002.png" id="A7.T12.g10" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/110;" width="476" height="110" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.32" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.32.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.32.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.32.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.32.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">11</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.32.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.32.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.32.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.32.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Split a Pipeline into Two Conditional Branches 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Modify an existing linear workflow so that active and inactive users are processed through separate branches. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "API Data Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Insert an "If" node between the "Map" node and the next downstream node. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Configure the "If" condition to check: 
<br class="ltx_break">‘item.active === true‘ 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Add a new "Send Email" node for the true branch. 
<br class="ltx_break">5. Set the new "Send Email" subject to: 
<br class="ltx_break">‘Active user report‘ 
<br class="ltx_break">6. Connect the workflow so that: 
<br class="ltx_break">- ‘HTTP Request -&gt; Map -&gt; If‘ 
<br class="ltx_break">- The ‘true‘ output of "If" goes to the new "Send Email" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">- The ‘false‘ output of "If" goes to the existing downstream path that originally followed "Map". 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.33" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.33.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.33.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.33.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.33.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.33.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.34" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.34.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.34.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.34.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_001.png" id="A7.T12.g11" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/122;" width="476" height="122" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.35" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.35.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.35.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.35.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.35.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;">12</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.35.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.35.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.35.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.35.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Add a New Output Branch to a Switch Node 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Add a new output case to a Switch node in a complex pipeline and wire it to an existing downstream node. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Enterprise Data Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. In the main "Switch" node, add a new case labeled ‘priority_urgent‘, do not include "expr" field. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Connect the new ‘priority_urgent‘ output to the same "Edit Fields (Set)" node currently connected to the "default" output. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Do not change any other routes or node settings. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.36" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.36.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.36.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.36.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.36.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.36.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Ground truth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.37" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.37.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.37.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.37.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_011.png" id="A7.T12.g12" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/153;" width="476" height="153" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.38" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.38.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.38.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.38.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.38.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;">13</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.38.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.38.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.38.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.38.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Rewire Edges in a Pipeline 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Rewire existing connections in a complex pipeline without adding, deleting, or reconfiguring any nodes. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Enterprise Data Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Disconnect the edge from the top-row "No Operation" node to the top-row "Merge" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Connect that same "No Operation" node to the "Switch" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Rewire the ‘priority_low‘ output of the "Switch" to the lower "Edit Fields (Set)" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">5. Do not create, delete, move, or reconfigure any nodes. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.39" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.39.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.39.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.39.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
