</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.40" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.40.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.40.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.40.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;"><img src="2606.14397v1/images/graph_gt_pngs/tc_graph_013.png" id="A7.T12.g13" class="ltx_graphics ltx_align_left ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/153;" width="476" height="153" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.41" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.41.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.41.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.41.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.41.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;">14</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.41.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.41.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T12.3.41.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T12.3.41.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Insert a Filter and Modify Sort in a Pipeline 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Make multiple changes to an existing pipeline: insert a Filter, reconfigure a Sort, and delete a trailing Limit node. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "API Data Pipeline" workflow. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Insert a "Filter" node between the "Map" and "Sort" nodes. 
<br class="ltx_break">3. Configure the "Filter" to pass only items where ‘item.email.includes(".org")‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">4. Change the "Sort" node to use field ‘email‘ with direction ‘desc‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">5. Delete last "Limit" node. 
<br class="ltx_break">6. The final path must be: ‘HTTP Request -&gt; Map -&gt; Filter -&gt; Sort‘. 
<br class="ltx_break">7. Do not add any other nodes. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T12.3.42" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T12.3.42.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9D9;padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T12.3.42.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
