<span id="A7.T13.3.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T13.3.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T13.3.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFECD9;">3</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T13.3.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T13.3.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T13.3.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T13.3.12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Place Cubes in All Octants 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Create a new scene and place one cube in each of the eight 3D octants at symmetric coordinates. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Create a new scene named "Octant Cubes". 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Generate cubes by assigning one default cube to each octant in 3D space, positioned at coordinates with absolute values of (1, 1, 1). Name all the cubes as Cube. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
