</span></td>
<td id="A7.T13.3.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T13.3.15.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:300.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T13.3.15.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A7.T13.3.15.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"># Reorder Elements Along X-Axis 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## GOAL 
<br class="ltx_break">Rearrange four objects into a specified order along the positive X-axis with uniform spacing between centers. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">## STEPS 
<br class="ltx_break">1. Open the "Row of Objects Scene". 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Reorder the elements as sphere, cone, cube, and cylinder along the positive X-axis. Final distance between centers of consecutive objects must be equal to 1. 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"># RESULT FORMAT 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘json 
<br class="ltx_break">{"answer": "done"} 
<br class="ltx_break">‘‘‘</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
